# ClipsOS V2

Read `AGENTS.md` at the project root for all architecture rules, naming conventions, and code quality standards.

## Key Files
- `AGENTS.md` — Master directive (MUST read first)
- `memory-bank/projectbrief.md` — Architecture overview
- `memory-bank/systemPatterns.md` — Code patterns
- `memory-bank/activeContext.md` — Current phase
- `docs/ClipsApp-PRD.md` — Full product requirements
- `docs/PERMISSIONS-MATRIX.md` — Role × feature matrix

## Non-Negotiable Rules
1. Every table has `tenant_id` (except tenants/profiles)
2. RLS on every public table
3. Never hard-code statuses/stages/video types — use lookup tables
4. TypeScript strict mode — no `any`
5. Finance data is Owner-only
